{"id":"7343100c647769a6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr.md","title":"弱1泛型不能Schnorr随机","display":"thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr — 弱1泛型不能Schnorr随机","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr","aliases":["43-thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr"],"display":"thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr — 弱1泛型不能Schnorr随机","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]","[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Lemma 11.16.12 (Kurtz [165])","source_printed_pages":"296","source_pdf_pages":"316","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weak1generic-not-schnorr — 弱1泛型不能Schnorr随机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 11.16.12 (Kurtz [165])"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"296"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"316"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>；柱集与串的有效编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给出避免草稿错排的直接论证。固定所有有限串的可计算枚举σ_i，令U_n=⋃_i[σ_i0<sup>(n+i+2)]。它是稠密有效开集，μ(U_n)≤Σ_i2</sup>(-n-i-2)≤2<sup>(-n)，且从第m项起的测度尾和≤2</sup>(-n-m-1)，所以μ(U_n)一致可计算。弱1泛型点属于每个U_n，因此落入该Schnorr零集。草稿此处末句误写为不属于交集，已按定义与论证纠正。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Lemma 11.16.12 (Kurtz [165])，印刷页296，PDF页316。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omeg